{
  "_readme": [
    "Konfiguracja hooków Fleet Commander (v0.0.23), zdjęta z .claude/settings.json.",
    "Pliki FC nie zostały usunięte — przeniesione do .claude/fleet-commander/ (agents, guides, hooks, prompts).",
    "Ten katalog jest dla Claude Code nieaktywny: agenty wykrywane są tylko z .claude/agents/, hooki tylko przez wpis w settings.json.",
    "Aby przywrócić: wklej klucz 'hooks' poniżej do .claude/settings.json — ścieżki wskazują już na nową lokalizację, nie trzeba nic przenosić z powrotem.",
    "Uwaga przed przywróceniem: skrypty w hooks/ mają tryb 644 (bez bitu +x), a run-hook.sh robi na nich exec — każde zdarzenie kończy się 'Permission denied' (exit 126). Wymaga chmod +x .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/*.sh.",
    "Druga uwaga: send_event.sh POST-uje na http://localhost:4680/api/events — hooki mają sens tylko przy uruchomionym dashboardzie FC."
  ],
  "_fleetCommanderVersion": "0.0.23",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh session_start on_session_start.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh session_end on_session_end.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh stop on_stop.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "StopFailure": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh stop_failure on_stop_failure.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh subagent_start on_subagent_start.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh subagent_stop on_subagent_stop.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Notification": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh notification on_notification.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh pre_compact on_pre_compact.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh tool_use on_post_tool_use.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "TeammateIdle": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh teammate_idle on_teammate_idle.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "TaskCreated": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh task_created on_task_created.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/fleet-commander/hooks/run-hook.sh tool_error on_tool_error.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
